| **Strict AND (v1)** | 0.816 / 0.816 | 0.941 | 420.25 | 0.786 / 0.8726 |
| **V1 + aug** | **0.823 / 0.905** | **1.00** | 430.01 | **0.956 / 0.9125** |
| **V1 + aug + bucket** | 0.823 / 0.897 | 0.988 | **409.25** | 0.956 / 0.9037 |

